<title>UK: FHLB SETS $200 MLN FIVE-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>FHLB SETS $200 MLN FIVE-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN BOARD</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.68	MATURITY    20.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) NO DEF    SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL FROM 20.AUG.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
